<title>UK: Depfa sets 1.0 billion mark December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Depfa sets 1.0 billion mark December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Bank, DG Bank,</p>
<p>Dresdner Bank and Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    14.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.91     PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBREIF 403</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
